\title{September PhD Student Monitoring 2026}
\author{liamoc}
\date{2026-09-18}
\import{table-macros}
\p{Today we had our regular PhD monitoring event, where all students and faculty in the [Foundations](https://comp.anu.edu.au/join/foundations/) cluster go to a remote location for a day, listen to some talks, and hold interviews with students where we ensure they're well supported. We went, as with [last time](loc-0043), to the [Cuppacumbalong Homestead](https://cuppacumbalong.com.au/en/) for this event. }
